                                "sense_id": "c1303402-4c50-37fe-b1a0-847eb0d20580",
                                "text": "He had his mouth close to Lily's ear, hoping that this might be interpreted as affection. He felt Lily go rigid beneath the arm he had clasped about her, but that painted smile stayed on her face."
